   "h": "e232dc44",
   "html": "<sk-mc data-h=\"e232dc44\" data-id=\"mc-rc-filter-003\" data-type=\"single\" data-difficulty=\"1\" data-topic=\"rc-filter\" data-pin-last=\"false\" data-source=\"uebung-04:2\">\n<div class=\"sk-stem\">\n<p>Ein RC-Tiefpass hat\n<sk-math data-tex=\"UiA9IDFcLFxtYXRocm17a1xPbWVnYX0=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\nund\n<sk-math data-tex=\"QyA9IDEwMFwsXG1hdGhybXtuRn0=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.\nWie groß ist\n<sk-math data-tex=\"Zl9cbWF0aHJte2d9\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>?</p>\n</div>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"A\" data-correct=\"true\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\n<sk-math data-tex=\"MXssfTU5XCxcbWF0aHJte2tIen0=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p><sk-math data-tex=\"Zl9cbWF0aHJte2d9ID0gMS8oMlxwaSBSQyk=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"B\" data-correct=\"false\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\n<sk-math data-tex=\"MTBcLFxtYXRocm17a0h6fQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p>Das ist <sk-math data-tex=\"MS8oUkMp\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>,\nalso\n<sk-math data-tex=\"XG9tZWdhX1xtYXRocm17Z30=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\nin <sk-math data-tex=\"XG1hdGhybXtzXnstMX19\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>:\nFaktor <sk-math data-tex=\"MlxwaQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\nvergessen.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"C\" data-correct=\"false\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\n<sk-math data-tex=\"MTU5XCxcbWF0aHJte0h6fQ==\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p>Zehnerpotenz falsch: mit\n<sk-math data-tex=\"QyA9IDFcLFxtYXRocm17XG11IEZ9\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\ngerechnet.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<sk-opt data-key=\"D\" data-correct=\"false\"><div class=\"sk-opt-text\">\n<sk-math data-tex=\"NjJ7LH04XCxcbWF0aHJte2tIen0=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\n</div><div class=\"sk-why\" hidden>\n<p><sk-math data-tex=\"MlxwaS8oUkMp\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math> statt\n<sk-math data-tex=\"MS8oMlxwaSBSQyk=\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.</p>\n</div></sk-opt>\n<div class=\"sk-explanation\" hidden>\n<p>Bei <sk-math data-tex=\"Zl9cbWF0aHJte2d9\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>\ngilt\n<sk-math data-tex=\"fFx1bmRlcmxpbmV7Wn1fQ3wgPSBS\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>,\nalso\n<sk-math data-tex=\"MlxwaSBmX1xtYXRocm17Z30gUkMgPSAx\" data-display=\"0\"></sk-math>.</p>\n</div>\n</sk-mc>"
